WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.835
-Today the House
Judiciary Committee

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.870
debated two articles
of impeachment

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.105
against President Trump,

00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:08.508
setting the stage for a vote
of the full House.

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.576
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.576 --> 00:00:14.847 line:0%
[ Suspenseful theme plays ]
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:14.847 --> 00:00:16.449
Well, here we are.

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.717
We're gettin' closer to the day
when the full House will vote

00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:20.720
on two articles
of impeachment against Trump.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.223
For three years, this moment
has somehow felt both inevitable

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:26.292
and also impossible,
at the same time.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:29.329
We've all been in this weird
limbo where, every day,

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:30.997
Trump does something
that makes you think,

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:32.598
"That dude's
gonna get impeached,"

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:34.267
[ Laughter ]
and then, the next morning,

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.602
you wake up, check your phone,
and there's a news alert

00:00:36.602 --> 00:00:38.404 line:0%
that says something like,
"Republicans Shrug Off

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:40.006 line:0%
Trump Threats
to Release Nude Pics

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:41.774 line:0%
unless France Sells Him
the Eiffel Tower."

00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:44.209 line:0%
[ Laughter, clapping ]
Then, you tune in to CNN,

00:00:44.209 --> 00:00:46.011 line:0%
and, sure enough, there's
one Republican after another,

00:00:46.011 --> 00:00:49.148 line:0%
dodging reporters and literally
hiding in elevators

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:50.649 line:0%
to avoid answering questions.

00:00:50.649 --> 00:00:53.186
Republicans spent
so much time in elevators,

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:55.655
Ted Cruz is just gonna start
showin' up to the Senate

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:56.889
lookin' like a bellhop.

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:58.758
[ Laughter, clapping ]

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:02.361
Thanks to Trump, Republicans
in elevators react to reporters

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:04.931
the way the rest of us react
to that weird coworker

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:06.732
who's always inviting you
to his DJ gigs.

00:01:06.732 --> 00:01:08.167
"Oh, [bleep], it's Gary.

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:09.736
[ Laughter ]
He's gonna give me one

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:12.405
of those flyers that says
"DJ G-Money."

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:15.908
[ Laughter ]
In fact, Trump, himself,
is reportedly angry

00:01:15.908 --> 00:01:17.843
that he's being impeached,
and also,

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:20.346
shocked! that it took
this long to get 'im.

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:21.548
CNN reported yesterday that,

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:22.982
after all the scandals
he's weathered

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.851
and all the crimes
he's been implicated in,

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:27.086
Trump's actually surprised
that this!

00:01:27.086 --> 00:01:28.688
This is the one that got 'im.

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:30.056
-We're hearing President Trump

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:32.057
is growing
increasingly aggravated

00:01:32.057 --> 00:01:34.226
over the likelihood
that he will be impeached.

00:01:34.226 --> 00:01:36.195
Meanwhile, a separate
Trump advisor said

00:01:36.195 --> 00:01:38.164
the president
has been preparing,

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:41.066
in his mind, for some time,
that this moment would arrive,

00:01:41.066 --> 00:01:43.302
suspecting, for the better part
of the last year,

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:45.004
that Democrats
would try to impeach him

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:48.007
after taking control
of the House last year.

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:51.043
This advisor said Mr. Trump
is somewhat taken aback,

00:01:51.043 --> 00:01:53.545
we should note,
that it's the Ukraine scandal

00:01:53.545 --> 00:01:55.014
that is leading to this moment,

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:57.116
leading to his impeachment
in the House.

00:01:57.116 --> 00:01:58.450
If we could put this
up onscreen.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:01.287
This advisor said --
and we wanna show this quote --

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.756
"Frankly, I think he's
a little surprised" --

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:05.691
talking about the
president here --

00:02:05.691 --> 00:02:07.994
"that it's the Ukraine
thing that's done it."

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:11.063
[ Laughter ]
-That is an amazing confession.

00:02:11.063 --> 00:02:13.766
Think about that.
That's like getting pulled over

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:16.202
for a broken taillight
and sayin', "Taillight?!

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:18.537
I got, like, ten dead bodies
in my trunk!

00:02:18.537 --> 00:02:21.808
[ Laughter ]
Ain't this a kick in the head!"

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:24.043
[ Applause ]
But it's true:

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:27.447
Trump has blatantly and
repeatedly abused his powers.

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:29.315
He obstructed justice
in the Russia probe,

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:31.884
inflicted human rights abuses
on migrant families,

00:02:31.884 --> 00:02:34.954
profited from his office,
solicited a bribe,

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:37.190
and paid hush money
in an illegal scheme

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:40.026
to cover up an affair
and, on top of all that,

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:42.161
he attacked a 16-year-old
climate activist,

00:02:42.161 --> 00:02:44.864
Greta Thunberg, simply
for trying to save the planet

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:46.298
from an existential crisis.

00:02:46.298 --> 00:02:49.201
Trump tweeted today -- today! --
"Greta must work

00:02:49.201 --> 00:02:51.104
on her Anger Management problem,
-[Murmuring]

00:02:51.104 --> 00:02:53.873
-then go to a good old fashioned
movie with a friend!

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:55.608
Chill Greta, Chill!"

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:58.644
[ Laughter ]
You want her to chill?!

00:02:58.644 --> 00:03:00.746
Whenever you scream,
you look like a tick

00:03:00.746 --> 00:03:02.181
that's about to burst.

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:03.883
[ Laughter and applause ]
I mean, look at him.

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:06.552
He looks like a rabid possum
hissing at you

00:03:06.552 --> 00:03:08.020
for disturbing his nest.

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:09.088
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:12.759
Also, you are a 73-year-old man

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:14.861
attacking a 16-year-old activist

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:16.462
because she cares
about the environment.

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:18.731
Think about how sad that is.
You are a husk of a man.

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:20.833
Actually, not even. For there
to have been a husk of a man,

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:23.269
there would've had to have
been a man, to begin with.

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:26.105
You're a husk of a husk.
You're a Russian nesting doll

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:27.273
of husks.

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:29.375
[ Laughter and applause ]
And, on top of all that,

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:30.743
-Ow!
-on top of all that,

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:33.245
at this very moment,
Trump's henchmen are still

00:03:33.245 --> 00:03:35.047
in the process
of committing crimes for him.

00:03:35.047 --> 00:03:37.550
His lawyer, Rudy Giuliani,
traveled to Europe

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.251
and, specifically, Ukraine,

00:03:39.251 --> 00:03:42.121
to keep digging up dirt
on Trump's political opponents.

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:44.490
-With the heat on Rudy Giuliani
in the midst

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:47.993
of the Ukrainian investigation,
Rudy has decided

00:03:47.993 --> 00:03:50.362
there's no better time
for a trip to Eastern Europe,

00:03:50.362 --> 00:03:52.131
interviewing people
about Ukraine.

00:03:52.131 --> 00:03:54.900
More specifically,
working on a new project

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:58.137
to discredit the Democrats'
case against the president.

00:03:58.137 --> 00:04:00.706
-That's right: In the middle
of an impeachment inquiry

00:04:00.706 --> 00:04:05.211
about Ukraine, Rudy decided
to go back to Ukraine.

00:04:05.211 --> 00:04:07.246
That's like going back
to the bank you robbed

00:04:07.246 --> 00:04:10.315
to get your Christmas card photo
taken on the security camera.

00:04:10.315 --> 00:04:12.318
[ Laughter, clapping ]

00:04:12.318 --> 00:04:15.121
Rudy also went to Ukraine
as he himself is personally

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:18.023
under criminal investigation
for his ties to Ukraine.

00:04:18.023 --> 00:04:20.759
And one of his already
indicted henchmen, Lev Parnas,

00:04:20.759 --> 00:04:22.962
is also in even more
hot water now.

00:04:22.962 --> 00:04:25.698
Remember? These two,
Lev and his buddy Igor,

00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:28.367
you know, the guys who look like
two cab drivers from Queens

00:04:28.367 --> 00:04:30.002
fightin' over a passenger.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:30.002 --> 00:04:31.036
[Slavic accent]
Hey, I was here first.

00:04:31.036 --> 00:04:32.205
I'm going to kill you.

00:04:32.205 --> 00:04:33.339
Okay. See you at Christmas.

00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:34.707
[ Laughter ]

00:04:34.707 --> 00:04:35.975
You are my brother.

00:04:35.975 --> 00:04:36.975
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.975 --> 00:04:38.543
We have to say,
prosecutors asked

00:04:38.543 --> 00:04:40.113
to revoke Parnas' bail

00:04:40.113 --> 00:04:41.814
and revealed
an incriminating detail

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:44.083
about a large sum of money
from a foreign country

00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:46.552
and you'll never guess which
country that money came from.

00:04:46.552 --> 00:04:49.087
-And U.S. prosecutors
are seeking to revoke bail

00:04:49.087 --> 00:04:52.024
for Lev Parnas,
an associate of Rudy Giuliani,

00:04:52.024 --> 00:04:55.227
for lying about a $1 million
payment from Russia.

00:04:55.227 --> 00:04:58.231
-That's right, he got $1 million
from someone in Russia.

00:04:58.231 --> 00:05:00.633
The only way that
could be more suspicious is

00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:02.801
if it came in the form
of a gym bag filled

00:05:02.801 --> 00:05:05.070
with unmarked rubles
with a luggage tag that said,

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.972
"V. Putin."
[ Laughter ]

00:05:06.972 --> 00:05:09.108
It's like all the threads
of every Trump scandal

00:05:09.108 --> 00:05:12.245
are comin' together: Rudy,
secret money, Ukraine, Russia.

00:05:12.245 --> 00:05:13.913
I wouldn't be surprised if,
at this point,

00:05:13.913 --> 00:05:15.848
Robert Mueller himself
came to arrest Trump,

00:05:15.848 --> 00:05:17.450
tore off his mask,
and revealed that he was

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:18.851
Stormy Daniels the whole time.

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:22.054
[ Laughter, oohing ]
Now, usually -- usually --

00:05:22.054 --> 00:05:23.956
Republicans are able
to dodge questions

00:05:23.956 --> 00:05:26.292
about all this
by hiding in elevators.

00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:27.626
That's one of the many reasons

00:05:27.626 --> 00:05:29.495
these public impeachment
hearings have been so valuable:

00:05:29.495 --> 00:05:31.464
Republicans have been
forced to sit there

00:05:31.464 --> 00:05:33.432
and confront the evidence
in plain sight

00:05:33.432 --> 00:05:35.301
and we've all been able to see,
in real time,

00:05:35.301 --> 00:05:37.002
that they have no defense;
they have nothing.

00:05:37.002 --> 00:05:40.373
That's why, for example,
so many of them talk so fast.

00:05:40.373 --> 00:05:43.442
They're hoping you can't
make out any of the words

00:05:43.442 --> 00:05:46.012
because they know what
they're saying is bull[bleep].

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:47.980
-"Ambassador Taylor recalled
that Mr. Morrison

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.715
told Ambassador Taylor
that I told Mr. Morrison

00:05:49.715 --> 00:05:51.384
that I conveyed this message
to Mr. Yermak

00:05:51.384 --> 00:05:53.286
on September 1, 2019,
in connection

00:05:53.286 --> 00:05:54.987
with Vice President Pence's
visit to Warsaw."

00:05:54.987 --> 00:05:56.522
They forget the fact
the two guys on the call,

00:05:56.522 --> 00:05:58.024
President Trump
and President Zelensky,

00:05:58.024 --> 00:05:59.358
have said repeatedly
there was no pressure,

00:05:59.358 --> 00:06:00.793
no linkage, no pushing.
[inhales]

00:06:00.793 --> 00:06:02.294
They forget the fact
Ukraine didn't know

00:06:02.294 --> 00:06:05.131
aid was held at the time of the
call and they forget the fact,

00:06:05.131 --> 00:06:07.700
most important, they did nothing
to get the aid released,

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:09.535
no announcement of any type
of investigation.

00:06:09.535 --> 00:06:11.270
-He sounds like the narrator

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.206
at the end of a drug commercial,
warning you

00:06:13.206 --> 00:06:15.140
about the side effects.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.742
[as Jordan] Impeachment
may cause fever, headache,

00:06:16.742 --> 00:06:17.910
vomiting, diarrhea,
blurry vision,

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.045
and, of course, loss of balance.

00:06:19.045 --> 00:06:20.746
[ Laughter ]

00:06:20.746 --> 00:06:24.517
These guys don't have
any actual argument.

00:06:24.517 --> 00:06:27.486
So they just speed through
a string of right-wing buzzwords

00:06:27.486 --> 00:06:30.088
as fast as possible and hope it
sounds like a coherent sentence.

00:06:30.088 --> 00:06:31.290
But, sometimes,

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:33.892
even they get confused
by their own bull[bleep],

00:06:33.892 --> 00:06:35.961
like the time Lindsey Graham
tried to attack the motives

00:06:35.961 --> 00:06:38.764
of Trump's handpicked
ambassador Gordon Sondland,

00:06:38.764 --> 00:06:42.335
the guy who gave $1 million
to Trump's inaugural committee,

00:06:42.335 --> 00:06:44.103
who said, unequivocally,
under oath,

00:06:44.103 --> 00:06:46.271
that there was
a quid pro quo with Ukraine

00:06:46.271 --> 00:06:48.841
and who pulled a "Fleabag"
in this photo,

00:06:48.841 --> 00:06:50.676
where he looked directly
into the camera

00:06:50.676 --> 00:06:51.944
during his hearing.

00:06:51.944 --> 00:06:53.512
[ Laughter ]
That's fantastic.

00:06:53.512 --> 00:06:54.981
That looks like
the post-credits scene

00:06:54.981 --> 00:06:56.616
from "Ferris Bueller's Day Off."

00:06:56.616 --> 00:06:57.717
[ Laughter ]

00:06:57.717 --> 00:06:59.251
Well, Graham tried to claim,

00:06:59.251 --> 00:07:01.420
on Fox News, that Sondland

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:03.789
was somehow working with the
Democrats on the committee

00:07:03.789 --> 00:07:06.191
and that the Ukrainian company
Hunter Biden worked for,

00:07:06.191 --> 00:07:08.994
which was called Burisma,
deserved to be investigated

00:07:08.994 --> 00:07:10.629
and, yet,
Graham couldn't pronounce

00:07:10.629 --> 00:07:14.066
either the name Burisma
or the name Sondland.

00:07:14.066 --> 00:07:16.468
-There was concern that
the prosecutor was getting

00:07:16.468 --> 00:07:18.104
too close to Hunter Biden,

00:07:18.104 --> 00:07:20.406
that people from Bearmoosa,
whatever the name

00:07:20.406 --> 00:07:21.506
[ Laughter ]
of the company,

00:07:21.506 --> 00:07:23.275
a conversation with Sunderland.

00:07:23.275 --> 00:07:24.743
Now, here's a question:

00:07:24.743 --> 00:07:27.412
Why did Sunderland
change his testimony?

00:07:27.412 --> 00:07:29.348
Was there a connection
between Sunderland

00:07:29.348 --> 00:07:31.817
and Democratic operatives
on the committee?

00:07:31.817 --> 00:07:35.387
It makes me incredil--
incredibly suspicious.

00:07:35.387 --> 00:07:38.190
Why did Sunderland
change his mind?

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:39.692
-I don't know.
Why did you

00:07:39.692 --> 00:07:41.294
change his name to Sunderland?

00:07:41.294 --> 00:07:42.795
[ Laughter ]

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:44.496
It's like when your dad
tries to text you

00:07:44.496 --> 00:07:45.565
about a movie he just saw,

00:07:45.565 --> 00:07:47.433
but can't remember any
of the names.

00:07:47.433 --> 00:07:48.967
"I like that actor.
What's his name?

00:07:48.967 --> 00:07:50.503
Leonardo DeCrapio?"

00:07:50.503 --> 00:07:51.804
[ Laughter ]

00:07:51.804 --> 00:07:53.172
We've seen this
in hearing after hearing.

00:07:53.172 --> 00:07:54.773
Republicans just ramble
nonsensically

00:07:54.773 --> 00:07:56.241
because it's their only tactic.

00:07:56.241 --> 00:07:58.611
All the evidence is there
as Democrats laid out

00:07:58.611 --> 00:08:00.713
in their speeches
during the Judiciary Committee's

00:08:00.713 --> 00:08:03.616
markup hearing on Wednesday
night and again this morning.

00:08:03.616 --> 00:08:08.387
-President Donald J. Trump
wielded the enormous powers

00:08:08.387 --> 00:08:11.857
of the presidency to cheat
in the 2020 election.

00:08:11.857 --> 00:08:14.493
-We must hold
this president accountable

00:08:14.493 --> 00:08:17.463
for corrupting our democracy.

00:08:17.463 --> 00:08:23.202
-The ongoing pattern of this
president's abuse of power

00:08:23.202 --> 00:08:25.470
his obstruction
of investigations,

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:29.875
refusing to turn over
even one document.

00:08:29.875 --> 00:08:33.845
-In this scheme, Donald Trump
was not an incidental player.

00:08:33.845 --> 00:08:35.615
He was the central player.

00:08:35.615 --> 00:08:40.852
-The president was the first
and best witness in this case.

00:08:40.852 --> 00:08:44.957
The president is
the smoking gun.

00:08:44.957 --> 00:08:46.759
-It's true:
Trump is the smoking gun

00:08:46.759 --> 00:08:49.061
and, much like a gun,
his brain is only capable

00:08:49.061 --> 00:08:50.763
of holding six words at a time.

00:08:50.763 --> 00:08:52.298
[ Laughter ]

00:08:52.298 --> 00:08:54.233
Republicans have
no coherent defense,

00:08:54.233 --> 00:08:55.568
so they just have
to make stuff up

00:08:55.568 --> 00:08:56.836
and, in some cases, I mean,

00:08:56.836 --> 00:08:58.237
they're literally
making up words.

00:08:58.237 --> 00:09:00.572
Today, during the
Judiciary Committee debate,

00:09:00.572 --> 00:09:02.107
the ranking member,
Doug Collins,

00:09:02.107 --> 00:09:04.376
complained, once again,
about the impeachment process,

00:09:04.376 --> 00:09:06.746
which is both
in the Constitution

00:09:06.746 --> 00:09:08.781
and has been open to the public,

00:09:08.781 --> 00:09:10.549
and Collins seemed
to make up a word.

00:09:10.549 --> 00:09:12.517
-It is a amazing, though,
to hear, now, they've gotten

00:09:12.517 --> 00:09:14.453
really sensitive about process
on the majority side.

00:09:14.453 --> 00:09:16.989
When we actually pointed out
the tragedy and the travesty

00:09:16.989 --> 00:09:18.591
of being a rubber stamp
in the committee

00:09:18.591 --> 00:09:20.993
and the gentleman from Florida
has brought out a couple things.

00:09:20.993 --> 00:09:23.095
But let me just remind. As he
said, just a few minutes ago,

00:09:23.095 --> 00:09:24.763
the White House
could've seen everything.

00:09:24.763 --> 00:09:26.064
No. It's just like
everything else.

00:09:26.064 --> 00:09:27.766
It all goes to the whim
and the whimber

00:09:27.766 --> 00:09:29.068
of the chairman
and the majority.

00:09:29.068 --> 00:09:31.303
-The whim and the whimber
sounds like the name

00:09:31.303 --> 00:09:33.606
of a Russian soap opera
about Lev and Igor.

00:09:33.606 --> 00:09:35.641
[ Laughter ]

00:09:35.641 --> 00:09:38.110
Republicans keep insisting
that Trump was just worried

00:09:38.110 --> 00:09:40.446
about corruption, in general,
and that he wasn't demanding

00:09:40.446 --> 00:09:43.181
an investigation into his
political rival Joe Biden,

00:09:43.181 --> 00:09:45.417
even though Trump mentioned
the Bidens by name

00:09:45.417 --> 00:09:47.486
on his infamous phone call,
multiple times.

00:09:47.486 --> 00:09:49.722
So, that argument
is obviously ridiculous.

00:09:49.722 --> 00:09:52.457
This whole thing was all about
Joe Biden and the Democrats.

00:09:52.457 --> 00:09:53.659
Trump and Republicans

00:09:53.659 --> 00:09:56.328
had full control of the
government for two years

00:09:56.328 --> 00:09:58.664
and didn't say a word
about corruption in Ukraine

00:09:58.664 --> 00:10:00.032
until Biden announced
his candidacy

00:10:00.032 --> 00:10:02.567
and denying that basic fact
makes you look ridiculous,

00:10:02.567 --> 00:10:03.802
which is what happened

00:10:03.802 --> 00:10:05.570
to Republican lawyer
Steve Castor

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:07.406
at the Judiciary hearing
on Monday,

00:10:07.406 --> 00:10:08.874
when he tried to claim
that Joe Biden

00:10:08.874 --> 00:10:11.877
was not a front-runner
in the presidential race.

00:10:11.877 --> 00:10:14.313
-Sir, would you agree
that Joe Biden

00:10:14.313 --> 00:10:16.515
was a leading
Democratic contender

00:10:16.515 --> 00:10:18.284
to face President Trump in 2020?

00:10:18.284 --> 00:10:19.284
-I wouldn't agree with that.

00:10:19.284 --> 00:10:20.419
-You disagree with it.

00:10:20.419 --> 00:10:22.588
So, sir, it's your testimony
-Too early.

00:10:22.588 --> 00:10:24.823
[ Laughter ]
-that President Trump
did not view

00:10:24.823 --> 00:10:27.026
President Biden to be
a legitimate contender,

00:10:27.026 --> 00:10:28.661
is that correct?
-I don't know what
President Trump believed

00:10:28.661 --> 00:10:30.061
or didn't believe,
but it's too early.

00:10:30.061 --> 00:10:33.132
-Sir, as part of your inquiry,
did you determine whether

00:10:33.132 --> 00:10:34.800
President Trump tweeted, at all,

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.135
about former
Vice President Joe Biden

00:10:37.135 --> 00:10:40.505
between January and July 25th,
and how many times?

00:10:40.505 --> 00:10:41.873
-I didn't look at Twitter.

00:10:41.873 --> 00:10:43.542
I try to stay
off Twitter, lately.

00:10:43.542 --> 00:10:46.678
[ Laughter ]
[Castor] I know.

00:10:46.678 --> 00:10:48.546
I don't get my news on Twitter.

00:10:48.546 --> 00:10:51.317
I keep all my information
right here in my grocery bag.

00:10:51.317 --> 00:10:53.152
[ Laughter ]

00:10:53.152 --> 00:10:56.188
I've got some old shoes
I'm takin' to Goodwill and...

00:10:56.188 --> 00:10:58.157
[ Laughter ]

00:10:58.157 --> 00:11:00.025
got some trail mix that I made.
Uh.

00:11:00.025 --> 00:11:01.927
[ Laughter ]
Oh, here's that Metro card.

00:11:01.927 --> 00:11:04.730
I found my Metro card, you guys.
[ Laughter ]

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.898
Republicans seem to believe
that, if you disagree with them,

00:11:06.898 --> 00:11:08.768
you are illegitimate,
that the process

00:11:08.768 --> 00:11:10.569
of holding a lawless
president responsible

00:11:10.569 --> 00:11:12.904
for his abuses of power
is illegitimate

00:11:12.904 --> 00:11:15.507
and that Trump and his cohorts
are simply above the law.

00:11:15.507 --> 00:11:18.810
And so, as the House prepares
to pass articles of impeachment

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:20.112
and move to a trial
in the Senate,

00:11:20.112 --> 00:11:21.947
Lindsey Graham, who chairs
the Judiciary Committee

00:11:21.947 --> 00:11:24.082
in the Senate,
has said he has one goal:

00:11:24.082 --> 00:11:25.750
to end the trial
as quickly as possible

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:27.119
without even calling witnesses.

00:11:27.119 --> 00:11:29.588
-My goal is to end this
as soon as possible,

00:11:29.588 --> 00:11:32.824
for the good of the country,
because I think it's a danger

00:11:32.824 --> 00:11:34.760
to the presidency
to legitimize this.

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:35.927
-A couple things here, then.

00:11:35.927 --> 00:11:37.897
Does that mean
no witnesses at all?

00:11:37.897 --> 00:11:41.200
-I don't need
any witnesses at all.

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:43.602
-Okay. And then --
-I am ready to go.

00:11:43.602 --> 00:11:45.037
-In terms of time,
-[Chuckle]

00:11:45.037 --> 00:11:47.639
-is it a week, is it two weeks,
is it a month, what is it?

00:11:47.639 --> 00:11:50.209
-It's closer to a week,
for sure.

00:11:50.209 --> 00:11:52.778
-A week?!
You wanna call zero witnesses

00:11:52.778 --> 00:11:54.245
and hold the trial in a week!

00:11:54.245 --> 00:11:55.981
Most trials take forever.

00:11:55.981 --> 00:11:57.482
Roger Stone's trial
took so long,

00:11:57.482 --> 00:11:59.752
it started in the 18th century.
Look at that!

00:11:59.752 --> 00:12:00.920
[ Laughter ]

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:03.021
That's his actual outfit
from the inauguration.

00:12:03.021 --> 00:12:05.957
He looks like he got arrested
for carjacking the Hindenberg.

00:12:05.957 --> 00:12:07.226
[ Laughter, clapping ]

00:12:07.226 --> 00:12:09.094
We now finally have
two articles of impeachment

00:12:09.094 --> 00:12:11.363
awaiting a full House vote,
which will likely make Trump

00:12:11.363 --> 00:12:13.165
the third president
in history to be impeached.

00:12:13.165 --> 00:12:14.933
Republicans have no defense.

00:12:14.933 --> 00:12:17.335
All they can do is
accuse Democrats of following...

00:12:17.335 --> 00:12:18.637
-The whim and the whimber.

00:12:18.637 --> 00:12:20.505
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:20.505 --> 00:12:25.578 line:0%
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

